      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One deployment serves any asset domain\n\nTransport - bus \u00b7 truck \u00b7 workshop equipment\nHealthcare - MRI \u00b7 ventilator \u00b7 ambulance\nRailway - locomotive \u00b7 coach \u00b7 track equipment",
